                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really hope this game will make a comeback as Etherlords 3, with many campaigns that players can enjoy. This game is truly one of the greatest and most unique games ever made, and even to this day, I haven’t found another game that can really match it.\n\nThe card-based battles, the fantasy world, and the way the characters and creatures are based on different elements from the world around us make Etherlords incredibly special.\n\nEtherlords is truly a legendary game. I really hope the developers will consider bringing it back with modern graphics, more campaigns, more creatures and spells, while keeping the original gameplay and unique elemental concept that made the series so memorable.\n\nPlease bring us Etherlords 3! 🙏🔥",
